<title>
Outside Warning Buzzer Removal and Installation
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0AA506014001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect negative (–) cable at battery.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove left side front fender lining. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9A06004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect connector, and then remove outside warning buzzer (1).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0AA50024.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.276mm" ver = "01" gw = "183" gh = "140"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0AA506014002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0AA506015">Outside Warning Buzzer Inspection</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure.
</ptxt>
